    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing the global push for AI regulation and ethics. The image features interconnected abstract lines and nodes symbolizing global collaboration, with faint outlines of diverse architectural styles (e.g., Indian parliament, US Capitol, UK Houses of Parliament) subtly integrated into the background. In the foreground, a stylized, glowing AI brain or circuit board is gently cradled by abstract, protective human hands, surrounded by a subtle digital security shield. The color palette should be professional yet engaging, using blues, greens, and subtle golds to convey trust, growth, and innovation, with a hint of red for caution around the security shield. The overall composition should be dynamic and forward-looking, emphasizing the balance between technology and governance.",
