      neutralCase: "Codeberg\'s policy is a strategic alignment with its community\'s values and operational sustainability, rather than an outright judgment on AI or crypto. It reflects the platform\'s specific niche and resources, acknowledging that not all technologies fit every open-source model. This creates clearer boundaries for its users while allowing other platforms to cater to different development needs.",
