    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing the convergence of traditional finance (TradFi) and decentralized finance (DeFi). The image features two distinct, glowing pathways or bridges meeting in the center: one stylized with traditional stock market charts, financial symbols, and a suit-clad silhouette, and the other with blockchain nodes, crypto token icons, and a more futuristic, digital aesthetic. They intertwine and connect over a digital landscape. The overall mood is innovative and forward-looking, with elements of data flow and secure connection. Use a wide-angle perspective to emphasize the broad scope of this convergence. The color palette should combine corporate blues and greens with vibrant crypto purples and golds, creating a sense of transition and integration.",
