      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "A moderately bullish outlook (60%) is warranted, given the current macro liquidity tailwinds and positive institutional signals. However, significant risks from regulatory shifts and potential technical hurdles (30% neutral, 10% bearish) necessitate cautious optimism.",
