      neutralCase: "The SafePal breach is an isolated incident within the vast crypto ecosystem, unlikely to have a systemic impact on overall market prices or adoption trends. It serves as a periodic reminder of inherent risks, prompting individual users to be more careful, but not fundamentally altering the industry\'s trajectory. The market will absorb this event and continue its growth, albeit with ongoing security challenges.",
      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "A neutral-to-slightly-bearish short-term outlook is most probable. While the breach is not systemic, it adds to the cumulative narrative of crypto security risks, potentially causing minor investor hesitation. However, the long-term drive for innovation and user education will likely mitigate significant lasting damage, leading to a more robust, albeit slowly, maturing market.",
