    socialHeadlines: ["Major Crypto Update! Binance gets green light in UAE, Coldcard steps up security with AI, and Bitcoin\'s price target just got a huge upgrade from Standard Chartered. #Bitcoin #CryptoNews", "From UAE clearance to AI-powered security: the latest #Crypto news is packed! Plus, a fresh #Bitcoin price prediction that\'ll get you talking. Read now!", "Standard Chartered just made a HUGE #Bitcoin prediction – could $126K be on the horizon? Get the full story on market sentiment and security breakthroughs. #CryptoMarket", "Your weekly crypto digest: Binance\'s regulatory win, Coldcard\'s AI security boost, and conflicting Bitcoin price forecasts from top experts. Don\'t miss out! #CryptoUpdate", "AI for #Bitcoin security & a potential $126K target? The crypto world is buzzing! See how Binance, Coldcard, and Standard Chartered are shaping the future. #Blockchain"],
