    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing global economic forces. On one side, abstract rising red arrows symbolize inflation pressure, with numbers like \'2.9% CPI\' subtly integrated into the design. On the other side, green upward-pointing arrows or a stable, ascending line represent market resilience or growth, specifically highlighting abstract energy sector symbols (e.g., stylized oil derricks, wind turbines, or flowing energy waves) acting as a counterbalance. In the background, subtle, blurred elements of a stock market chart and a compass rose denote global markets and direction. The overall composition should convey a sense of tension and balance between inflationary pressures and market stability. Clean, modern, digital art style with a professional financial aesthetic. Avoid literal depictions of people or specific buildings. Focus on abstract data representation and economic concepts, with a cool color palette for stability and warm tones for inflation.",
