    featuredImagePrompt: "A wide-angle, cinematic scene depicting a stylized digital cityscape at dusk, with towering data streams representing Bitcoin\'s stability on one side and chaotic, swirling energy representing Dogecoin\'s speculation on the other. In the foreground, subtle elements like a small, secure digital vault symbolizing institutional holdings (Metaplanet) and a distant, blurred silhouette of the Federal Reserve building with a faint glow, indicating its influence. The overall mood should be dynamic but professional, capturing the divergent trends without being overly dramatic. Use a blend of cool blues, purples, and subtle orange accents. The perspective should be slightly aerial, looking down upon the digital landscape.",
